--TEST--
an enum's own declaration answers nothing where a read of one of its cases is recorded against it, the case below pinning that the read is there to be found from the other end, `rule:ide/five-features-are-one-reference-index`
--FILE--
<?nvs
enum Sta<|>tus: int
{
    case Draft = 1;
    case Live = 2;
}

var $s = Status::Draft;
--REQUEST--
references
--EXPECT--
none
